#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "アーキテクチャ"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:3
msgid "Background and rationale are in [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md). This file records the current layout and policies; it is not a settled specification."
msgstr "背景と根拠は [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md) にあります。本書は現時点の構成と方針の記録であり、確定仕様ではありません。"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:5
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "構成"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:7
msgid "One crate (lib + bin). No workspace split until dependency boundaries settle."
msgstr "crate は一つ（lib + bin）。依存境界が固まるまで workspace 分割はしません。"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "Module"
msgstr "モジュール"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "Responsible for"
msgstr "担当すること"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "Not responsible for"
msgstr "担当しないこと"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "`syntax`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "tokenizing, AST, source spans, syntax diagnostics"
msgstr "トークン化、AST、ソース位置、構文診断"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "execution, file writes"
msgstr "実行、ファイル書き込み"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "`runtime`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "cycle, pattern/hold space, command evaluation"
msgstr "サイクル、pattern/hold space、コマンド評価"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "CLI argument parsing"
msgstr "CLI 引数の解釈"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "`io`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "record reading and output"
msgstr "レコードの読み込みと出力"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "script syntax"
msgstr "スクリプト構文"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "`cli`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "mode selection, argument validation, exit status"
msgstr "モード決定、引数検証、終了状態"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md
msgid "a second implementation of the transformation logic"
msgstr "変換ロジックの別実装"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:16
msgid "`regex`, `analysis`, and `plan` are not part of P0; they are added from P1 onward."
msgstr "`regex`・`analysis`・`plan` は P0 に含めず、P1 以降で追加します。"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:18
msgid "Policies"
msgstr "方針"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:20
msgid "P0 has only the sequential VM. The CLI and the Rust API share one path (parse, then run)."
msgstr "P0 は逐次 VM のみ。CLI と Rust API は同じ経路（パースしてから実行）を使います。"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:21
msgid "Unsupported syntax is a compile-time error and is never silently reinterpreted."
msgstr "未対応構文はコンパイル時エラーとし、黙って別の意味に解釈しません。"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:22
msgid "Input is held as bytes. The record terminator is kept separate from the record body."
msgstr "入力はバイト列として保持します。レコード末尾の区切りは本文と区別して扱います。"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:24
msgid "Provenance and licensing"
msgstr "由来とライセンス"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:26
msgid "GNU sed and GNU grep sources live in `reference/` (untracked) for reading behavior only. Code is not copied from them."
msgstr "GNU sed と GNU grep のソースは、挙動を調べるためだけに `reference/`（git 管理外）に置きます。そこからコードは写しません。"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:27
msgid "Expected test output is generated by running GNU sed as a command (see `tests/README.md` in the repository)."
msgstr "テストの期待値は GNU sed をコマンドとして実行して生成します（リポジトリの `tests/README.md` を参照）。"

#: ../../ARCHITECTURE.md:28
msgid "The project is licensed under `MIT OR Apache-2.0`. Nothing derived from GPL code may be added, because that would conflict with the license."
msgstr "プロジェクトは `MIT OR Apache-2.0` でライセンスされています。このライセンスと衝突するため、GPL のコードに由来するものは追加してはいけません。"

#~ msgid "The project license is undecided. `Cargo.toml` has no `license` field until it is."
#~ msgstr "プロジェクトのライセンスは未決定です。決まるまで `Cargo.toml` に `license` は書きません。"

